<title>USA: Exide Electronics to review Danaher bid.</title>
<headline>Exide Electronics to review Danaher bid.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exide Electronics Group Inc said on Wednesday that its directors would review an unsolicited cash tender offer from Danaher Corp and that they would make a recommendation to Exide shareholders about the bid within 10 business days.</p>
<p>In addition, Exide, which makes uninterruptible power supply products, urged its shareholders not to act on the Danaher offer until it had made public its recommendation.</p>
</text>
